      "character": "muzhik",
      "text": "Yes! I saved two pretty girls from a biker gang that was harassing them!",
      "emotion": "happy",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l3",
      "character": "ded",
      "text": "Impressive. And how exactly did you do that?",
      "emotion": "surprised",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l4",
      "character": "muzhik",
      "text": "I stepped right in front of them and told those bikers I wasn't going to allow it!",
      "emotion": "smug",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l5",
      "character": "ded",
      "text": "And when was this?",
